    <!-- Privacy -->
    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Fitness Hub is a student project. It is not a medical device and does not give medical advice.\n\nWhat it reads: steps, distance, calories, heart rate, resting heart rate, sleep, workouts, SpO2 and weight from Health Connect, only for the types you allow. If you allow it, it also reads in the background, about every 3 hours. You can change this any time in Health Connect.\n\nWhat it writes: if you allow it, each finished gym workout is saved to Health Connect as a strength-training session (start, end and name only, no sets).\n\nWhere data is stored: only on this phone, in the app\'s private database. There is no account and no server. Cloud backup of the database is turned off.\n\nWhat leaves the phone: nothing in this version. A later version adds an optional AI coach. It is off by default and, when you turn it on, sends only a short, anonymous summary with rounded numbers, which you can preview before each request.\n\nYour control: you can revoke Health Connect access at any time. Uninstalling the app deletes all of its data.</string>
